{"v": 1, "ts": "2026-07-24T23:07:41Z", "actor": "ales_holubec.net", "type": "rfc_decision", "ref_id": "RFC-0012", "finding": "RFC-0012 (AAI self-improvement / friction feedback loop) proposed Option C (local spool + triage/upsert + separate maintainer processor) with 8 open questions.", "decision": "ACCEPTED Option C by owner. D1 default dest goodwind-cz/aai; D2 first release local+review+auto(opt-in, gated by D8); D3 shadow retention 14d, lower threshold; D4 no auto-update of existing issue w/o approval (auto opens new-fingerprint only); D5 private installs report upstream under hard/double redaction, identity omitted; D6 minimal field allowlist (OS family, AAI pin, Node major, skill+phase, failure class, fingerprint); D7 maintainer processing explicit-only first, scheduled-after-label later; D8 auto unlocks at >=70% acceptance over >=20 reports + 0 privacy incidents. Privacy guarantee shifts to mode-default local + minimal allowlist + hard redaction + auto gate (must be skill-suite-enforced). Status draft->accepted; implementation deferred to phased specs (Phase 0 first).", "source": "docs/rfc/RFC-0012-aai-self-improvement-feedback-loop.md (interrogation 2026-07-25)"}
{"v":1,"ts":"2026-07-25T07:20:00Z","actor":"ales_holubec.net","type":"rfc_decision","ref_id":"friction-record-v2-redaction","finding":"RFC-0012 Phase 2 triage (actionability/reproducibility/impact scoring, upsert, auto-gate) is blocked: the Phase-0/1 minimal spool persists only 8 structural fields + fingerprint (D6), no prose, so no triage signal beyond recurrence exists.","decision":"Accepted RFC friction-record-v2-redaction (schema v2 + D5 redaction). D1: add structured enum/bool signal fields (reproducible/impact/confidence/workaround/evidence_ref), schema_version=2, v1-compatible. D2: free-text summary is opt-in, default OFF, hard-redacted; default title templated from structured fields. D3: double redaction (capture + transmit). D4: fail-closed by dropping the field, keeping the structured record. D5: evidence_ref is a shape-restricted safe pointer; only summary is redacted, structured fields bypass by construction. Design only, no code.","source":"docs/rfc/RFC-DRAFT-friction-record-v2-redaction.md"}
