{"v":1,"ts":"2026-08-22T23:24:23Z","actor":"validation","type":"follow_up","id":"fu-ratchet-counter-line-undercount","ref_id":"drain-the-tripwire-known-offender-list","severity":"P3","finding":"TEST-014's entry counter is line-based, so two entries written on one line count as one and a TRIPWIRE_KNOWN_OFFENDERS+= append after the block counts as zero while both are live exemptions","decision":"the length ratchet is only as strong as its parse; an exemption bash honours but the counter cannot see is exactly the silent hole the arm exists to prevent, and TEST-013's count==0 guard is blind to the same two shapes","source":"measured 2026-08-23 at 7c5a09c: count_ratchet_entries reports 1 for a table line holding two quoted entries (bash reports array length 2) and 0 for a copy carrying TRIPWIRE_KNOWN_OFFENDERS+=(\"aai-z|fu-z|docs/INDEX.md\") on the line above TRIPWIRE_HASH_DEGRADED=false"}
