{"v":1,"ts":"2026-08-24T09:08:08Z","actor":"orchestrator","type":"follow_up","id":"fu-lean-ac-heading-two-authorities","ref_id":"the-registry-has-no-outflow","severity":"P3","finding":"docs-audit --gate accepts a lean AC table under the heading Acceptance Criteria while generate-docs-index.mjs near-miss flags exactly that heading and demands Acceptance Criteria Status","decision":"the two checkers disagree on the canonical lean heading, so a doc the close gate passes is flagged by the index generator one step later; bit CHANGE-0161 mid-ceremony and cost a rework commit","source":"close ceremony of PR 283, docs/INDEX.violations.md generated 2026-08-24T09:06Z then cleared by renaming the heading"}
{"v":1,"ts":"2026-08-24T09:34:44Z","actor":"orchestrator","type":"follow_up","id":"fu-pgq-grep-error-reopened","ref_id":"the-registry-has-no-outflow","severity":"P3","finding":"pgq_scan sends grep stderr to /dev/null and treats a per-file error as count 0, so an unreadable file is reported as an improvement (reopens fu-pgq-scan-silent-on-grep-error)","decision":"the 5d accepted-residual drop misclassified this: the false-good was already reproduced (chmod 000), so it fails the no-bite and no-false-record bar; reopened per the reopen-on-bite protocol","source":"PR 283 Codex review P2 on docs/ai/decisions.jsonl line 520; original evidence in fu-pgq-scan-silent-on-grep-error"}
{"v":1,"ts":"2026-08-24T09:34:58Z","actor":"orchestrator","type":"follow_up","id":"fu-overview-project-from-dirname","ref_id":"the-registry-has-no-outflow","severity":"P3","finding":"generate-overview.mjs derives the project field from path.basename(ROOT) (line 343), so any non-canonically named checkout (worktree, CI dir) leaks its local directory name into the committed overview pages","decision":"bit PR 283: the close ceremony ran in a worktree named wt-registry and published that as the project title; the committed artifacts were hand-corrected, the generator still derives from the dirname","source":"PR 283 Copilot review on docs/ai/overview.html line 6; .aai/scripts/generate-overview.mjs:343"}
